msgstr "Gmail, Workspace"

#: app/src/add_account/post.rs:266
msgid "Outlook, 365"
msgstr "Outlook, 365"

#: app/src/add_account/post.rs:268
msgid "Custom domains too"
msgstr "Και προσαρμοσμένοι τομείς"

#: app/src/add_account/post.rs:270
